      "question": "Having participated in ---- interviews during her job search, Ms. McKray expects that she will be hired soon.",
      "choices": [
        "sizable",
        "countless",
        "plentiful",
        "much"
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "topic": "数量形容词",
      "keywords": "countless interviews quantifier",
      "answer_explain": "countless interviews 表示很多次、数不清的面试，贴合求职经历。much 修饰不可数名词，不能修饰 interviews；sizable 强调规模或体积大；plentiful 强调供应充足，在这里描述参加面试的次数不如 countless 自然准确。",
